0:02:40.000,0:02:41.500
What happened, brother? What are you doing here?

0:02:41.500,0:02:44.000
I don't know, Swami. The vehicle suddenly won't start.

0:02:44.000,0:02:45.500
Were you heading somewhere urgently?

0:02:45.500,0:02:48.500
