0:05:20.000,0:05:26.000
Enough dividing by caste, enough fighting over religion.

0:05:26.500,0:05:31.000
Humanity alone is true life.

0:05:31.500,0:05:37.500
Enough hating lives, enough breaking relationships.

0:05:38.000,0:05:44.000
Love is always the solution.
